From f2f1291cef5797843098e4b1a948d26ae32c9f90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SynEnergy AI <284274979+SynenergyAI@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:33:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] ggml-backend: add missing #include <string>

ggml-backend.cpp uses std::string (in a std::set<std::pair<...>>) without
including <string>. With the macOS 12 Command Line Tools libc++ the build
fails: "implicit instantiation of undefined template 'std::basic_string<char>'".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp
index 135464b..f5479c8 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-backend.cpp
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
 #include <set>
 #include <utility>
 #include <vector>
+#include <string>
 
 #ifdef __APPLE__
 #include <sys/types.h>
